Let's apply this to something physical to ground it.

30:34.720 --> 30:38.060
The note uses Newtonian gravity to separate them perfectly.

30:39.060 --> 30:41.620
Imagine a planetary body moving through space.

30:41.800 --> 30:41.960
Yeah.

