The planet itself, its velocity, the specific trajectory it is carving, that is the vector,

30:47.860 --> 30:49.400
the actual direction of flow.

30:49.980 --> 30:54.760
But the planet is moving because it is embedded in a gravitational potential field.

30:54.900 --> 30:55.160
Right.

30:55.260 --> 30:55.780
The environment.

